</head>
<body bgcolor=#ffffff text=#606080 link=#806060 vlink=#806060 alink=#806060>
<div align=left>
<font size=5>Plantainさん作品　感想掲示板</font>
<table cellpadding=4 cellspacing=0><tr><td align=left>
<form method=POST action="bbs.cgi">
